WEBVTT

00:00.640 --> 00:08.640
- Kanon! Kanon! Kanon! Kanon! Kanon! Kanon! Kanon! Kanon!
- Kanon! Kanon! Kanon! Kanon! Kanon! Kanon! Kanon! Kanon!

00:13.800 --> 00:15.900
How's everyone doing?

00:16.260 --> 00:19.010
I'm so happy to meet you all again!

00:22.110 --> 00:23.320
This way.

00:24.090 --> 00:26.770
Let's all have fun tonight!

00:30.790 --> 00:33.890
So, is everyone ready?

00:38.850 --> 00:41.000
Let's go!

00:52.890 --> 00:57.620
My feelings are like the rain
falling from the cloudy sky

00:58.380 --> 01:03.160
It stains the map in my dreams. Good grief!

01:03.900 --> 01:08.700
The cold wind blows toward me,
leaving me with a strained smile

01:09.430 --> 01:14.210
It's hazy ahead. Where
will this signpost lead me?

01:14.630 --> 01:20.499
Even if you become lost and lonely

01:20.500 --> 01:27.690
I will always shine on you!

01:28.780 --> 01:34.289
Kanon 100% Sun revolution

01:34.290 --> 01:39.789
Let's ride on the rainbow roller coaster!

01:39.790 --> 01:45.329
Kanon 100% Ribbon revolution

01:45.330 --> 01:50.839
I will give everyone the magic of smile

01:50.840 --> 01:56.660
Let tomorrow be another shiny day!

02:24.620 --> 02:28.000
- Over 10,000 Fans Attend Nakagawa Kanon at Maijima Town Halldassdsa

02:24.620 --> 02:26.310
News Flash

02:24.620 --> 02:28.000
A wave of glowsticks

02:26.311 --> 02:28.000
The Stadium Dominated!!

02:38.300 --> 02:42.799
Kanon-chan's songs are all so good!

02:42.800 --> 02:44.010
Oh no!

02:47.220 --> 02:48.325
Weather Girl

02:48.326 --> 02:49.430
Little Witch Kanon!

02:51.350 --> 02:54.939
I almost missed Kanon-chan's TV show.

02:54.940 --> 02:56.569
It's okay.

02:56.570 --> 02:58.359
Tomorrow will definitely be shiny!

02:58.360 --> 02:59.360
Yep!

03:00.150 --> 03:01.990
There were even bananas inside.

03:02.320 --> 03:03.360
That's right!

03:05.780 --> 03:11.120
Huh? Did everyone find out I'm a witch?

03:13.460 --> 03:14.330
I want to meet you!

03:14.331 --> 03:17.419
I want to meet you, Kanon-chan!

03:17.420 --> 03:22.050
Even though we go to the same
school, we don't get to hang out at all!

03:24.430 --> 03:28.509
Huh? An audition to be Kanon-chan's sister?

03:28.510 --> 03:33.310
An audition will be held for the role of sister
to the nationally renowned idol, Kanon-chan.

03:33.770 --> 03:38.440
The winner will get to sing alongside
the much-beloved Kanon-chan!

03:40.860 --> 03:42.610
And the audition's today!

03:43.070 --> 03:45.069
This must be fate!

03:45.070 --> 03:49.200
Starting today, I'll be
Kanon-chan's sister!

03:50.620 --> 03:52.120
Thanks for your work.

03:56.290 --> 03:58.209
Good job.

03:58.210 --> 04:00.299
Next is the audition's shoot.

04:00.300 --> 04:02.170
It's the one you've
been looking forward to.

04:03.420 --> 04:06.890
It's kind of embarrassing to
hold an audition for my sister.

04:07.390 --> 04:10.309
Thanks to <i>Weather Girl Little Witch Kanon</i>,

04:10.310 --> 04:13.890
there are now more young
girls among your fans.

04:16.400 --> 04:18.229
Go take a shower.

04:18.230 --> 04:21.610
You need to take care of your body so
you can be a role model for good kids!

04:21.860 --> 04:23.110
Okay!

04:29.240 --> 04:34.500
Why? I want to audition to
be Kanon-chan's sister, too!

04:35.290 --> 04:38.129
You see, you need to pass
the applicant screening first.

04:38.130 --> 04:41.710
Besides, you look about
as old as Kanon-chan herself.

04:42.300 --> 04:44.129
We aren't the same age.

04:44.130 --> 04:47.010
I'm roughly 300 years older than she is.

04:49.100 --> 04:51.719
Please hold on to your
official papers and go inside.

04:51.720 --> 04:52.620
That's that, then.

04:52.621 --> 04:54.640
You can't go in without
any official papers.

04:56.020 --> 05:02.020
If I had known about this, I would have asked
Kami-niisama about how a little sister acts.

05:07.950 --> 05:10.200
That's a loose soul!

05:11.740 --> 05:13.160
Hey, hold it!

05:13.540 --> 05:15.620
Let go of me!

05:18.670 --> 05:20.330
I already told you! You can't...

05:27.260 --> 05:29.930
That's a loose soul
that hasn't found a host!

05:30.430 --> 05:32.470
It might be looking for a host.

05:32.930 --> 05:35.020
I need to capture that loose soul quickly!

05:53.580 --> 05:55.080
Are you okay?!

06:11.390 --> 06:13.720
Elsie-san... is it?

06:18.940 --> 06:20.390
Kanon-chan?

06:21.270 --> 06:22.400
You've shrunk!

06:23.810 --> 06:25.979
Don't look!

06:25.980 --> 06:27.280
I-I'm sorry!

06:34.580 --> 06:36.370
I'll use my garment.

06:54.140 --> 06:55.680
Kanon-chan, just a second.

06:58.020 --> 06:59.979
There's no response.

06:59.980 --> 07:01.609
Thank goodness.

07:01.610 --> 07:05.269
I thought the loose soul hid in your body.

07:05.270 --> 07:07.689
But you...

07:07.690 --> 07:10.969
I've turned into a little girl, haven't I?

07:10.970 --> 07:13.070
How do I look?

07:15.160 --> 07:16.160
Here.

07:17.620 --> 07:18.829
What should I do?

07:18.830 --> 07:20.410
What should I do, Elsie-san?!

07:20.910 --> 07:23.039
I have work in a moment!

07:23.040 --> 07:24.920
I have to hold auditions for my sister!

07:24.960 --> 07:29.709
Okada-san even told me
to take care of my body!

07:29.710 --> 07:30.710
I suddenly...

07:30.760 --> 07:31.470
abruptly...

07:31.471 --> 07:33.089
all of a sudden...

07:33.090 --> 07:36.050
turned into a kid!

07:36.550 --> 07:38.430
Calm down, Kanon-chan!

07:41.430 --> 07:43.640
Leave your problem...

07:44.730 --> 07:47.399
Leave everything to me!

07:47.400 --> 07:49.360
And that's why we're calling you.

07:49.900 --> 07:52.699
So Nii-sama, what should I do?

07:52.700 --> 07:54.609
Why are you asking <i>me</i>?

07:54.610 --> 07:57.750
Nii-sama, help me!

07:58.120 --> 07:59.449
Don't wanna.

07:59.450 --> 08:02.000
The target this time
is the loose soul itself.

08:02.370 --> 08:04.500
That's <i>your</i> specialty, right?

08:06.500 --> 08:08.059
What do you want me to do?

08:08.060 --> 08:09.060
Kanon?

08:11.760 --> 08:13.220
Nii-sama!

08:13.590 --> 08:17.680
Besides, I'm in the middle of a
battle that I can't afford to lose!

08:17.680 --> 08:19.810
- TO OUR CUSTOMER
- PLEASE LINE UP BEFORE WE OPEN

08:18.140 --> 08:23.269
When you think about it, Kanon
probably shrunk because of the loose soul.

08:23.270 --> 08:26.190
Try to use that loose soul
sensor of yours to capture it.

08:26.480 --> 08:29.269
The loose soul cast a spell, so capture it.

08:29.270 --> 08:31.689
I got it! I'll give it a try!

08:31.690 --> 08:34.070
You're lining up for me next time!

08:35.650 --> 08:36.859
It's okay now!

08:36.860 --> 08:39.200
Kanon-chan, I'll get you back...

08:43.580 --> 08:48.540
Where did you go, Kanon-chan?!

08:50.630 --> 08:52.710
I ran here without thinking twice.

08:53.300 --> 08:55.590
What should I do now?

08:58.010 --> 09:00.810
Hey, you there. What's wrong?

09:02.180 --> 09:03.369
Didn't you know?

09:03.370 --> 09:07.310
You can't be here without permission.

09:09.230 --> 09:10.609
Are you by yourself?

09:10.610 --> 09:12.020
Is there an adult with you?

09:13.150 --> 09:15.240
Um... Um...

09:15.820 --> 09:17.240
Is something the matter?

09:17.860 --> 09:19.739
Well, there's this girl.

09:19.740 --> 09:21.449
Oh my, little girl.

09:21.450 --> 09:23.620
You look just like Kanon-chan.

09:26.000 --> 09:29.130
You really look just like her.

09:29.790 --> 09:32.550
Th-That's because I <i>am</i> her.

09:32.960 --> 09:36.759
That's it! You must be
here for the sister auditions!

09:36.760 --> 09:39.300
That's why you're
dressed up like that, right?

09:40.590 --> 09:42.049
Did you get lost?

09:42.050 --> 09:43.350
Um...

09:43.850 --> 09:46.059
It's okay. Come with me.

09:46.060 --> 09:47.730
I'll take you there.

09:48.230 --> 09:49.309
Okay, let's go.

09:49.310 --> 09:50.310
Eh?

09:50.520 --> 09:51.690
Eh?!

09:52.980 --> 09:55.400
I'm auditioning to be my own sister?!

09:55.940 --> 09:57.650
What's your name, little girl?

09:59.110 --> 10:00.660
Nakagawa...

10:01.320 --> 10:02.320
Maron.

10:02.660 --> 10:06.450
Maron-chan? Even your names are similar!

10:07.330 --> 10:07.368
Nakagawa Kanon Sister Audition

10:11.330 --> 10:13.289
That looks so gorgeous!

10:13.290 --> 10:16.919
Look! This ribbon is the
same as Kanon-chan's!

10:16.920 --> 10:19.130
You look just like Kanon-chan!

10:19.760 --> 10:21.219
That's so nice!

10:21.220 --> 10:22.889
This is getting troublesome.

10:22.890 --> 10:24.179
What should I do?

10:24.180 --> 10:26.179
You look just like her.

10:26.180 --> 10:28.180
What a shock!

10:33.230 --> 10:34.440
What's wrong?

10:35.400 --> 10:37.569
Well... Um...

10:37.570 --> 10:40.779
I'm not as cute as you girls are.

10:40.780 --> 10:42.239
That's not true at all.

10:42.240 --> 10:44.489
Those ribbons look really nice on you.

10:44.490 --> 10:46.120
They're really cute!

10:46.950 --> 10:48.539
Thanks.

10:48.540 --> 10:50.539
You really do look like Kanon-chan!

10:50.540 --> 10:52.289
R-Really?

10:52.290 --> 10:55.170
I really love Kanon-chan,
so I'm happy to hear that!

10:55.710 --> 10:58.839
Yep, I love her, too!

10:58.840 --> 11:03.089
That's why I'm really looking
forward to seeing her today.

11:03.090 --> 11:04.429
So are you, right?

11:04.430 --> 11:07.220
Y-Yeah!

11:08.350 --> 11:10.669
Really, what should I do?

11:10.670 --> 11:12.849
I can't believe I became like this!

11:12.850 --> 11:14.980
Kanon-chan is coming in now.

11:16.940 --> 11:18.189
Kanon-chan's coming!

11:18.190 --> 11:19.529
No way.

11:19.530 --> 11:21.700
How is that possible if <i>I'm</i> right here?

11:22.180 --> 11:23.339
Kanon-chan!

11:23.340 --> 11:25.280
It's Kanon-chan!

11:31.470 --> 11:32.879
Kanon-chan's here!

11:32.880 --> 11:34.960
She's so cute!

11:35.590 --> 11:36.969
What's this?

11:36.970 --> 11:39.100
Why am I over there?

11:40.390 --> 11:41.850
Can Kanon-chan...

11:42.850 --> 11:46.770
Can Kanon-chan really use magic?

11:47.270 --> 11:48.350
Magic?

11:48.940 --> 11:51.609
Weather Girl Little Witch Kanon!

11:51.480 --> 11:52.960
Weather Girl

11:51.610 --> 11:54.440
Airing every Sunday!

11:52.961 --> 11:54.440
Little Witch Kanon!

11:55.070 --> 11:58.160
Let tomorrow be another shiny day!

11:59.330 --> 12:05.039
She thinks I'm the same Kanon
as the witch girl from the TV show.

12:05.040 --> 12:07.249
Well, I do look sparkling in that show.

12:07.250 --> 12:09.210
I guess I do look like I could use magic.

12:10.880 --> 12:13.009
They're all so cute.

12:13.010 --> 12:16.930
It's kind of tough on my
schedule, but I'm glad I took the job.

12:18.760 --> 12:21.429
But what should I do now?!

12:21.430 --> 12:23.510
What happened to me?!

12:23.980 --> 12:25.640
Besides, that girl...

12:27.770 --> 12:29.229
There she is!

12:29.230 --> 12:30.230
Kanon-chan!

12:30.570 --> 12:31.820
Elsie-san!

12:33.360 --> 12:35.530
Huh? There are two Kanon-chans.

12:35.990 --> 12:38.619
We'll start filming soon.

12:38.620 --> 12:41.410
Please turn off your cell phones.

12:43.580 --> 12:45.159
My loose soul sensor!

12:45.160 --> 12:46.290
Which means...!

12:50.210 --> 12:51.500
I thought so!

12:53.260 --> 12:54.790
Turn off your phone!

12:55.170 --> 12:56.679
This isn't a phone!

12:56.680 --> 13:00.170
Also, that Kanon-chan
over there is a impos...

13:00.300 --> 13:07.680
Narusawa TV Side Entrance

13:00.300 --> 13:03.669
Restricted to Personnel Only

13:00.360 --> 13:02.930
Well, then, I can't let you stay inside.

13:05.100 --> 13:07.690
Let me in!

13:08.310 --> 13:10.690
Nakagawa Kanon's Sister Auditions!

13:11.560 --> 13:15.059
Our special judge is, of
course, none other than

13:15.060 --> 13:16.820
Kanon-chan!

13:19.720 --> 13:21.239
I-I feel nervous.

13:21.240 --> 13:25.119
I wonder if I can talk normally
in front of Kanon-chan.

13:25.120 --> 13:26.460
Elsie-san...

13:27.790 --> 13:29.580
Huh? Where are you going?

13:31.000 --> 13:32.919
Elsie-san!

13:32.920 --> 13:35.340
I'm here, Kanon-chan!

13:35.920 --> 13:37.969
This is bad. There are two of me!

13:37.970 --> 13:39.589
That one's a fake!

13:39.590 --> 13:41.389
That's a loose soul!

13:41.390 --> 13:42.469
Loose soul?

13:42.470 --> 13:43.809
Everyone's in danger.

13:43.810 --> 13:45.270
Let's go tell them!

13:46.570 --> 13:48.600
W-We're flying!

13:57.530 --> 14:00.659
The loose soul must be pretending to be you

14:00.660 --> 14:03.280
in order to find out which girl
has the largest gap in her heart.

14:08.370 --> 14:09.479
This is strange.

14:09.480 --> 14:11.370
She's not acting like herself.

14:11.670 --> 14:13.769
Now! Up next is Kozue-chan!

14:13.770 --> 14:14.770
Please go ahead!

14:34.610 --> 14:37.610
Stop right there, you impostor!

14:39.400 --> 14:41.860
Everyone, don't be fooled.

14:42.690 --> 14:45.240
This is the real Kanon-chan!

14:51.620 --> 14:57.460
A-Aren't you going to take this completely
genuine and real Kanon-chan seriously?

14:58.170 --> 15:00.169
This isn't going to work, Elsie-san.

15:00.170 --> 15:03.839
Right now, I still look like a kid.

15:03.840 --> 15:07.590
Unless there's something
we can use as proof...

15:08.600 --> 15:09.850
Proof...?

15:10.350 --> 15:11.969
My song...

15:11.970 --> 15:13.690
Kanon-chan?

15:16.980 --> 15:18.359
Even if I'm like this...

15:18.360 --> 15:19.560
I still have my singing voice!

15:19.860 --> 15:22.150
Hey, could you stop that already?

15:22.280 --> 15:28.720
I was lost in darkness and couldn't see,

15:28.770 --> 15:35.910
until I found a tiny light

15:36.150 --> 15:41.130
Now I walk forward

15:37.460 --> 15:41.550
My fans all came here to see me.

15:41.360 --> 15:44.210
I will not falter

15:42.720 --> 15:46.800
Don't use my likeness to make them sad!

15:45.020 --> 15:52.140
Steady as I go

15:53.640 --> 15:55.060
Damn you!

15:58.610 --> 15:59.730
What's that?!

16:10.620 --> 16:11.859
Oh no!

16:11.860 --> 16:12.860
We need to catch it!

16:15.870 --> 16:17.210
Elsie-san!

16:21.550 --> 16:22.550
Kozue-chan!

16:25.800 --> 16:32.100
I was lost in tumult and couldn't hear...

16:32.810 --> 16:35.020
Save me, Little Witch Kanon!

16:51.910 --> 16:53.470
How could something like this happen...

16:56.290 --> 16:58.629
This has to be a dream.

16:58.630 --> 17:02.250
I turned into a kid, and then...

17:03.550 --> 17:04.880
Kanon-chan!

17:06.840 --> 17:09.470
Elsie-san, are you okay?!

17:10.760 --> 17:12.430
I'm okay, kind of.

17:12.680 --> 17:15.599
Elsie-san, the little girls...!

17:15.600 --> 17:19.480
Yeah, they'll be in big trouble
if we don't hurry and save them!

17:20.310 --> 17:21.579
No way...

17:21.580 --> 17:22.730
What should I do?!

17:23.070 --> 17:24.730
Sing, Kanon-chan!

17:24.990 --> 17:25.860
Sing?

17:25.861 --> 17:30.030
The loose soul reacted
to your song earlier.

17:31.040 --> 17:32.649
The loose soul has negative energy.

17:32.650 --> 17:36.360
If you hit it with positive
energy by singing,

17:36.540 --> 17:38.209
I'm sure you can weaken it.

17:38.210 --> 17:41.460
Defeat it with your song!

17:41.790 --> 17:43.840
Defeat it... with my song?

17:45.460 --> 17:48.550
I was lost in turmoil and couldn't hear...

17:50.430 --> 17:51.510
With my song...

17:52.350 --> 17:53.479
That's right.

17:53.480 --> 17:55.019
Even if this is a dream...

17:55.020 --> 17:56.020
I need to...

17:56.540 --> 17:58.220
protect my fans!

18:08.490 --> 18:10.490
I transformed into Little Witch Kanon!

18:11.950 --> 18:14.700
All right! I'll save everyone!

18:14.950 --> 18:17.449
Kanon-chan, you're so wonderful!

18:17.450 --> 18:19.750
I need to hurry up, too!

18:22.750 --> 18:25.130
This is a dream, so I can fly!

18:42.400 --> 18:43.729
No!

18:43.730 --> 18:45.480
Stop right there!

18:46.530 --> 18:48.030
Little Witch Kanon!

18:49.950 --> 18:51.239
I'll end your evil schemes.

18:51.240 --> 18:53.529
Er, um...

18:53.530 --> 18:54.950
Y-You villain!

19:01.670 --> 19:04.120
I'll defeat you with my song!

19:08.960 --> 19:11.889
Paying no attention to the blackboard,

19:11.890 --> 19:15.829
I sneak a glance

19:15.830 --> 19:19.730
at the sweet face of my fantasy

19:20.820 --> 19:23.789
Suddenly, we're behind the school building

19:23.790 --> 19:27.669
talking about love

19:24.400 --> 19:26.900
Is she the real Kanon-chan?

19:27.670 --> 19:31.610
But it's not for me

19:33.040 --> 19:37.559
But I'll keep doing my best

19:36.620 --> 19:37.879
Do your best!

19:37.560 --> 19:43.190
to make you mine one day

19:37.880 --> 19:39.530
Do your best, Kanon-chan!

19:44.530 --> 19:47.380
A clueless Romeo

19:47.470 --> 19:50.459
Happy, happy, happy crescent

19:50.460 --> 19:53.199
A happy present for you

19:53.200 --> 19:55.949
I want you to know how I feel

19:55.950 --> 19:59.329
An eternal romance that's only for you

19:59.330 --> 20:02.309
Happy, happy, happy crescent

20:02.310 --> 20:04.529
I'm all yours

20:04.530 --> 20:06.209
I love you

20:06.210 --> 20:07.859
When will this end?

20:07.860 --> 20:11.590
Please hold me tight...

20:11.680 --> 20:13.240
Oh, crush of mine

20:15.530 --> 20:17.240
Sorry, I'm late!

20:25.790 --> 20:27.960
Loose soul in custody!

20:31.840 --> 20:33.759
You did it, Kanon-chan!

20:33.760 --> 20:34.960
That's so awesome!

20:39.010 --> 20:41.470
Let tomorrow be another shiny...

20:45.690 --> 20:46.690
Kanon-chan!

20:51.770 --> 20:52.770
Kanon!

20:57.780 --> 20:58.990
I was...

21:00.330 --> 21:02.869
Sheesh, that was strange.

21:02.870 --> 21:05.660
When I came to, I found
everyone here sleeping.

21:07.830 --> 21:09.170
They're awake.

21:09.880 --> 21:11.840
Were we all asleep?

21:14.170 --> 21:15.510
Elsie-san...

21:16.260 --> 21:20.010
I see. So that really <i>was</i> a dream.

21:20.600 --> 21:21.930
Kanon-chan!

21:25.270 --> 21:28.690
Kanon-chan, you really <i>can</i> use magic!

21:36.320 --> 21:38.700
Keep it secret, okay?

21:39.160 --> 21:40.160
Okay!

21:44.330 --> 21:48.039
It's nice that we caught the
loose soul without a hitch!

21:48.040 --> 21:51.080
And Kanon-chan was so cool!

21:51.840 --> 21:57.840
Maybe I should ask Kanon-chan to help me
capture loose souls, instead of Kami-niisama.

22:02.300 --> 22:06.520
Still, it kind of feels like there's
something different about this loose soul.

22:07.600 --> 22:10.480
Did I miss another one?!

22:20.030 --> 22:23.910
Now <i>I'm</i> the one who got turned into a kid!

22:26.870 --> 22:27.870
C'mere!

22:32.920 --> 22:37.049
The winner of the Nakagawa
Kanon Sister Auditions is...

22:37.050 --> 22:38.420
Kozue-chan!

22:41.010 --> 22:42.800
Congratulations, Kozue-chan.

22:43.050 --> 22:45.849
Starting today, I'll need you
to take care of me as my sister.

22:45.850 --> 22:48.390
Kanon-chan, I'm so happy!

22:51.400 --> 22:53.939
I need you, sparkling

22:53.940 --> 22:57.009
If you just stay beside me,

22:57.010 --> 23:03.549
then even the monochrome
scenery will become colorful

23:03.550 --> 23:09.480
I can't wait for the love
song colored like you

23:10.910 --> 23:16.369
Rainy, I bid the rainy season sky bye bye

23:16.370 --> 23:22.089
Sunshine, I peek through
the clouds from above

23:22.090 --> 23:27.519
Suddenly, my heart dances to the beat

23:27.520 --> 23:33.259
My summer vacation's
schedule is still a blank

23:33.260 --> 23:38.479
Hey, what will you do?

23:38.480 --> 23:46.480
Now, hurry and invite me,
whether to the seas or the mountains

23:47.230 --> 23:49.869
I need you. I am in love

23:49.870 --> 23:52.799
If you stay beside me always,

23:52.800 --> 23:58.359
I will shine a smile bright like the sun

23:58.360 --> 24:01.059
I need you, shiny

24:01.060 --> 24:03.979
If you just stay beside me,

24:03.980 --> 24:10.469
then even the monochrome
scenery will become colorful

24:10.470 --> 24:16.830
I can't wait for the love
song colored like you
